  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture interface Shape; enum Kind implements Shape; record Circle implements Shape; class Sq implements Shape. survey emits implements for Sq and Circle (plus dispatches_to Shape.area -> Sq.area / Circle.area) and nothing for Kind or Kind.area. The guard is now java.py L2767 (root_cause cites ~L2547); gikuk 495f9747f5 changed how the extends source is found but not which node types are handled. MECHANISM: java.py emits extends/implements only for class_declaration; enum_declaration carries no base meta the inheritance linker reads."  # 37aa
